WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.059 --> 00:00:00.819
- Hey Frank.

00:00:00.819 --> 00:00:02.159
- Kenny, how the hell are you?

00:00:02.159 --> 00:00:02.971
I hate that man.

00:00:02.971 --> 00:00:04.651
Takes up too much time in the coffee line.

00:00:04.651 --> 00:00:06.331
Wears flip flops on casual Friday.

00:00:06.331 --> 00:00:08.553
Sucks up to the boss
like it's his damn job.

00:00:08.949 --> 00:00:10.511
Who the hell does that?

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:19.011
- Frank?

00:00:19.011 --> 00:00:20.831
- Do you have the report?

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:23.415
- Why are we meeting back here?

00:00:23.415 --> 00:00:24.355
What's this?

00:00:24.355 --> 00:00:27.400
- It's our main means of
communication from here on out.

00:00:27.676 --> 00:00:29.269
Till we meet again.

00:00:29.889 --> 00:00:31.349
- Thank you.

00:00:33.272 --> 00:00:34.288
- Anybody got a napkin?

00:00:34.288 --> 00:00:34.988
- No.

00:00:34.988 --> 00:00:36.088
- Excuse me.

00:00:36.609 --> 00:00:37.849
- Did you just take my salad?

00:00:37.849 --> 00:00:38.608
- I put it back.

00:00:38.608 --> 00:00:40.805
- I know he did not just take my salad.

00:00:43.066 --> 00:00:44.661
- Hey Frank, did you see the email?

00:00:44.661 --> 00:00:45.281
Free lunch.

00:00:45.281 --> 00:00:47.001
- Oh I sure did.

00:00:47.122 --> 00:00:48.403
Who the hell does he think I am?

00:00:48.403 --> 00:00:49.743
Some whore in post-war Berlin

00:00:49.743 --> 00:00:51.997
salivating over stockings
and free chocolates?

00:00:51.997 --> 00:00:52.486
- What?

00:00:52.657 --> 00:00:53.705
- What?

00:00:55.505 --> 00:00:58.980
- In this company knowing
your way around Excel is sex

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:02.882
and let's just say, I make
a damn good spreadsheet.

00:01:02.882 --> 00:01:04.162
- So this is her?

00:01:04.162 --> 00:01:04.864
- Yes.

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:06.465
- So nice to finally meet you.

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:07.565
- She knows?

00:01:07.565 --> 00:01:08.542
- [Frank] Of course.

00:01:08.542 --> 00:01:10.779
- Don't worry, I'm having three affairs.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:12.399
Mike, Brian, and Andrew.

00:01:12.399 --> 00:01:14.094
- [Frank] We do it to get
ahead in this company.

00:01:14.094 --> 00:01:16.819
- Except Brian, he's just hot.

00:01:16.819 --> 00:01:18.021
- Are you serious?

00:01:20.423 --> 00:01:21.963
- And how does she benefit us again?

00:01:21.963 --> 00:01:23.523
- Office supplies.

00:01:26.456 --> 00:01:28.377
- I don't appreciate
how you treated Jackie

00:01:28.377 --> 00:01:29.797
today at the water cooler.

00:01:29.797 --> 00:01:31.158
- She'll be fine.

00:01:31.158 --> 00:01:32.622
- She already suspects we're not

00:01:32.622 --> 00:01:34.542
for her market research idea.

00:01:35.076 --> 00:01:36.856
- Do you guys want another cup?

00:01:37.268 --> 00:01:39.589
- Don't you understand
the symbolism of this?

00:01:39.589 --> 00:01:40.932
- It's very sexual.

00:01:40.932 --> 00:01:42.252
- White people.

00:01:44.552 --> 00:01:45.725
- You're doing a great job Frank.

00:01:45.725 --> 00:01:47.265
Really glad to have you on the team.

00:01:47.265 --> 00:01:49.785
I better watch out, you
might have my job soon.

00:01:51.248 --> 00:01:53.099
- I have him right where I want him.

00:01:53.099 --> 00:01:55.939
Vulnerable, unknowing, in my cross hairs.

00:01:55.939 --> 00:01:58.482
Now it's just a matter of
deciding when to strike.

00:01:58.482 --> 00:01:59.542
- I can hear you.

00:01:59.542 --> 00:02:00.628
- No he can't.

00:02:00.628 --> 00:02:01.966
- Yes I can.

00:02:01.966 --> 00:02:03.506
- Not how this works.

